<description><div class='je_rdata_container je_html' style='text-align:start'><div class='je_preview'><p>RemoteViz 샘플을 Android, iOS, MobileWeb 상에서 성능상, 기능상 이슈는 없는지 검토해본다.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style="line-height: 1.42857;">아래는 evaluation license key file text (</span>c:\OpenInventor\9.6.0C++Visual2010x64\License\password.dat)<span style="line-height: 1.42857;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style="line-height: 1.42857;">----</span></p> <p><span style="line-height: 1.42857;"></span>FEATURE OpenInventorSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=113EB3C85DA0<br> FEATURE MeshVizXLMSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=16EC380426C6<br> FEATURE VolumeVizLDMSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=DA7C312490B0<br> FEATURE HardCopySDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=6F57171416AE<br> FEATURE ImageVizSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=002BBCDA11C4<br> FEATURE RemoteVizSDK mcslmd 10.0 10-jul-2016 uncounted HOSTID=DEMO TS_OK SIGN=00C763F049A2</p> <p><span style="line-height: 1.42857;">----</span></p> <p><span style="line-height: 1.42857;"></span></p> <p><span style="line-height: 1.42857;">아래는 관련 메일:</span></p> <p>----</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <table style="border-collapse: collapse;"> <tbody> <tr> <th align="right"><b>To:</b></th> <td>"Mariano, Morgan" &lt;<a href="mailto:Morgan.Mariano@fei.com">Morgan.Mariano@fei.com</a>&gt;</td> </tr> <tr> <th align="right"><b>Subject:</b></th> <td>Evaluation request for Open Inventor C++</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>Dear Thomas Min</p> <p>Thank you for requesting an evaluation copy of Open Inventor C++ software from FEI</p> <p>***DOWNLOAD ADDRESS***<br> You can download a copy of the product package from:</p> <p><a href="http://www.fei-software-center.com/open-inventor/packagedownload-xjwi0unz">http://www.fei-software-center.com/open-inventor/packagedownload-xjwi0unz</a></p> <p>***LICENSE KEYS***<br> Please use the following license keys during your evaluation period:</p> <p>FEATURE OpenInventorSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=113EB3C85DA0<br> FEATURE MeshVizXLMSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=16EC380426C6<br> FEATURE VolumeVizLDMSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=DA7C312490B0<br> FEATURE HardCopySDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=6F57171416AE<br> FEATURE ImageVizSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=002BBCDA11C4</p> <p>NOTE: The licenses provided above must be copied in the [OIVHome]/license/password.dat or in the [OIVHOME]/arch*release/license/password.dat directory in order to unlock the product (Where OIVHome is the installation path of the Open Inventor package)</p> <p>In order to maximize your experience with the software we would initially suggest looking at the code examples in the Mentor section (located in [install directory], src, Inventor, examples, Mentor), as this contains simplistic examples of how to code base Open Inventor functionality. Code example for the additional extension packages can be found in the relevant sections. There are also a number of demo applications included with the product (along with source code) that show more complex functionality, and these are also a good point of reference</p> <p>***QUESTIONS?***<br> If you have technical or other questions, please do not hesitate to contact me. As necessary, I can put you in direct contact with my Application Engineer, who will be able to answer your questions and help you to get answers much more quickly than might otherwise be possible</p> <p>Best regards,<br> Mariano, Morgan<br> <a href="mailto:morgan.mariano@fei.com">morgan.mariano@fei.com</a><br> +33 (0) 556 13 36 41&nbsp;</p> <p>-----</p> <p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class='je_sep' style='display:none'>&nbsp;&zwnj;</div><div class='je_cdata' style='display:none'><!--&lt;p&gt;RemoteViz 샘플을 Android, iOS, MobileWeb 상에서 성능상, 기능상 이슈는 없는지 검토해본다.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height: 1.42857;"&gt;아래는 evaluation license key file text (&lt;/span&gt;c:\OpenInventor\9.6.0C++Visual2010x64\License\password.dat)&lt;span style="line-height: 1.42857;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height: 1.42857;"&gt;----&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height: 1.42857;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;FEATURE OpenInventorSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=113EB3C85DA0&lt;br /&gt; FEATURE MeshVizXLMSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=16EC380426C6&lt;br /&gt; FEATURE VolumeVizLDMSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=DA7C312490B0&lt;br /&gt; FEATURE HardCopySDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=6F57171416AE&lt;br /&gt; FEATURE ImageVizSDK mcslmd 9.6 22-jun-2016 uncounted VENDOR_STRING=SDK-Demo:thomas.mi HOSTID=DEMO SIGN=002BBCDA11C4&lt;br /&gt; FEATURE RemoteVizSDK mcslmd 10.0 10-jul-2016 uncounted HOSTID=DEMO TS_OK SIGN=00C763F049A2&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height: 1.42857;"&gt;----&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height: 1.42857;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="line-height: 1.42857;"&gt;아래는 관련 메일:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;----&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;table style="border-collapse: collapse;"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;th align="right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;To:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/th&gt; &lt;td&gt;"Mariano, Morgan" &amp;lt;&lt;a href="mailto:Morgan.Mariano@fei.com"&gt;Morgan.Mariano@fei.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/t